# Illvoi Light Jammer has flash: on Bot2's turn 2, with Lightning Bolt aimed at Elvish Mystic on the stack, Bot1 casts it. Entering, it attaches to
# the Mystic, which gains hexproof until end of turn (CR 702.11b): the Bolt's target is now illegal and it fizzles (CR 608.2b). Equipped the Mystic is a
# 2/3 (+1/+2). On turn 3 the "until end of turn" part is over: it is a 2/3 with no keyword, still equipped.

